// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <locale/keys_pt_abnt2.h>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

&lt {
    flavor = "balanced";
    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
    quick-tap-ms = <250>;
    require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
};

&sk { quick-release; };

/ {
    behaviors {
        hrm: homerow_mod {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
        };

        shift_bspc_del: shift_bspc_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "SHIFT_BSPC_DEL";
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DELETE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT)>;
        };

        lt_bspc_r: lt_bspc_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "LT_BSPC_R";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&shift_bspc_del>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <10 11 12 13 21 22 23 24>;
        };

        hrm_l: homerow_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_LEFT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <31 9 19 30 8 18 29 7 17 28 6 16 27 5 15 26 37 36 35>;
        };

        hrm_r: homerow_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_RIGHT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34 34>;
        };

        hrm_l_hwu: homerow_mod_left_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_LEFT_HWU";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <31 9 19 30 8 18 29 7 17 28 6 16 27 5 15 26 37 36 35>;
        };

        hrm_r_hwu: homerow_mod_right_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MOD_RIGHT_HWU";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34 34>;
        };
    };

    macros {
        os_focus_notification: os_dismiss_notification {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LG(R)>;
            label = "OS_DISMISS_NOTIFICATION";
        };

        os_end_session: os_end_session {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(DELETE))>;
            label = "OS_END_SESSION";
        };

        os_lock_screen: os_lock_screen {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(BACKSPACE))>;
            label = "OS_LOCK_SCREEN";
        };

        txt_assignment: txt_assignment {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_ASSIGNMENT";
        };

        txt_equals: txt_equals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_EQUALS";
        };

        txt_nequals: txt_nequals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EXCL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_NEQUALS";
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        left_super {
            bindings = <&kp LGUI>;
            key-positions = <12 13>;
        };

        right_esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
                &kp PT_Q        &kp PT_W            &kp PT_E         &kp PT_R              &kp PT_T     &kp PT_Y     &kp PT_U              &kp PT_I                &kp PT_O            &kp PT_P
                &hrm LGUI PT_A  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_S  &hrm LCTRL PT_D  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_F  &kp PT_G     &kp PT_H     &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_J  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_K  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_L  &hrm LGUI PT_SEMI
&sk LEFT_SHIFT  &kp PT_Z        &kp PT_X            &kp PT_C         &kp PT_V              &kp PT_B     &kp PT_N     &kp PT_M              &kp PT_COMMA            &kp PT_DOT          &kp PT_FSLH        &sl 7
                                                    &lt 5 ESC        &lt 1 PT_SPACE        &lt 3 TAB    &lt 4 ENTER  &lt 2 BACKSPACE       &lt 6 DELETE
            >;
        };

        navigation {
            bindings = <
                &none               &none                  &none                        &none                &none    &os_focus_notification  &kp LC(PT_MINUS)      &kp LC(LS(PT_EQUAL))  &kp LC(PT_EQUAL)     &kp LC(PT_N0)
                &hrm LEFT_GUI HOME  &hrm LEFT_ALT PAGE_UP  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PAGE_DOWN  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT END  &none    &kp LEFT_ARROW          &hrm LEFT_SHIFT DOWN  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL UP  &hrm LEFT_ALT RIGHT  &hrm LEFT_GUI PRINTSCREEN
&studio_unlock  &none               &none                  &none                        &none                &none    &kp CAPSLOCK            &kp F2                &kp F6                &kp F7               &kp F11                    &os_end_session
                                                           &none                        &none                &none    &none                   &kp K_MENU            &os_lock_screen
            >;
        };

        symbols {
            bindings = <
            &kp PT_PIPE            &kp PT_DLLR           &kp PT_LBRC                &kp PT_RBRC              &txt_assignment    &none  &none                     &none                       &none                  &none
            &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_AMPS  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_DQT  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_LPAR  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_RPAR  &kp PT_EXCL        &none  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_EQUAL  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_PRCNT  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_HASH  &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_STAR
&caps_word  &kp PT_AT              &kp PT_PLUS           &kp PT_LBKT                &kp PT_RBKT              &kp PT_BSLH        &none  &none                     &none                       &none                  &none                  &none
                                                         &kp PT_GRAVE               &kp PT_UNDER             &kp PT_MINUS       &none  &none                     &none
            >;
        };

        numbers {
            bindings = <
       &none                  &none                  &none                       &none                    &none    &kp PT_DLLR   &kp PT_N1              &kp PT_N2                &kp PT_N3            &kp PT_UNDER
       &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_FSLH  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_STAR  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_MINUS  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_PLUS  &none    &kp PT_PRCNT  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_N4  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_N5  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_N6  &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_DOT
&none  &none                  &none                  &none                       &none                    &none    &none         &kp PT_N7              &kp PT_N8                &kp PT_N9            &kp PT_COMMA          &none
                                                     &none                       &none                    &none    &kp PT_EQUAL  &kp PT_N0              &none
            >;
        };

        media {
            bindings = <
            &kp C_REWIND  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp C_FAST_FORWARD  &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
            &kp C_PREV    &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp C_NEXT          &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&bt BT_CLR  &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1          &bt BT_SEL 2          &bt BT_SEL 3        &bt BT_SEL 4    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &studio_unlock
                                                &kp C_STOP            &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE    &kp K_MUTE      &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        function {
            bindings = <
       &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F10
       &kp LEFT_GUI  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &none    &none  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11
&none  &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F12  &none
                                   &none             &none           &none    &none  &none   &none
            >;
        };

        shortcuts {
            bindings = <
       &none          &none          &none          &none          &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &kp LG(PT_N1)  &kp LG(PT_N2)  &kp LG(PT_N3)  &kp LG(PT_N4)  &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &kp LG(PT_N5)  &kp LG(PT_N6)  &kp LG(PT_N7)  &kp LG(PT_N8)  &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                                     &none          &none          &none    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        accents {
            bindings = <
       &none         &none         &none             &none         &none    &none  &none         &none         &none         &none
       &kp PT_GRAVE  &kp PT_CARET  &kp PT_TILDE      &kp PT_ACUTE  &none    &none  &kp PT_ACUTE  &kp PT_TILDE  &kp PT_CARET  &kp PT_GRAVE
&none  &none         &none         &kp PT_C_CEDILLA  &none         &none    &none  &none         &none         &none         &none         &none
                                   &none             &none         &none    &none  &none         &none
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers { compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers"; };
};
